---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Marketing Renegades | Build the Marketing. Build the Business."
  description="Marketing Renegades helps independent business owners build better marketing systems, implement them, and grow businesses that depend less on the owner doing everything personally."
>
  <div class="page">
    <Header />

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <header class="home-hero">
        <div class="home-glow"></div>
        <div class="wrap home-hero-in rv">
          <span class="ey">For independent owners who want to build something stronger</span>
          <h1 class="disp">
            <span>Build the marketing.</span>
            <span class="gold">Build the business.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="home-lead">Marketing Renegades helps independent business owners build the systems that create opportunity — and eventually build companies that don't require the owner to personally carry everything.</p>
          <p class="home-sub">We start with a strong focus on mortgage professionals because that's the world we know best. The bigger idea is simple: better tools, better marketing capability, better businesses.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#ways-to-build">See where to start <span class="ar">→</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://community.gorenegades.com">Join the Renegades</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mq-track">
        <span>Build <span class="sl">/</span> Learn <span class="sl">/</span> Implement <span class="sl">/</span> Lead <span class="sl">/</span> Grow <span class="sl">/</span> Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> </span><span>Build <span class="sl">/</span> Learn <span class="sl">/</span> Implement <span class="sl">/</span> Lead <span class="sl">/</span> Grow <span class="sl">/</span> Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> </span>
      </div></div>

      <!-- PROBLEM / PHILOSOPHY -->
      <section class="sec sec-ink">
        <div class="narrow rv">
          <span class="ey">The bigger problem</span>
          <h2 class="disp">Being good at the work doesn't automatically build <span class="g">a good business.</span></h2>
          <p class="sec-lead">A lot of independent owners get very good at serving the customer, closing the loan, doing the job, or solving the problem. Then they discover the business still depends on them to create every opportunity, remember every follow-up, and keep every plate spinning.</p>
          <p class="home-body">Marketing Renegades exists to help close that gap. We use software where software helps. We teach strategy where understanding matters. We build things together when implementation is the hard part. And as the business grows, the conversation gets bigger than marketing.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PATHS -->
      <section class="sec sec-black" id="ways-to-build">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="rv path-head">
            <span class="ey">Three ways to build</span>
            <h2 class="disp">Start where <span class="g">you actually are.</span></h2>
            <p class="sec-lead">You don't need every Renegade offer. You need the next useful thing for the problem you're trying to solve.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="path-grid rv">
            <a class="path-card" href="/crm">
              <div class="path-num">01</div>
              <div class="path-kicker">The tools</div>
              <h3>Renegade CRM</h3>
              <p>Put your contacts, follow-up, communication, campaigns, calendars, pipelines and automation in one place instead of trying to run marketing from memory and a pile of disconnected apps.</p>
              <span class="path-link">Explore the CRM →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="path-card featured" href="/academy">
              <div class="path-num">02</div>
              <div class="path-kicker">The build</div>
              <h3>Renegade Academy</h3>
              <p>An eight-week live implementation semester where mortgage professionals learn the strategy and build the actual marketing system together — inside the same CRM they'll keep using.</p>
              <span class="path-link">See the Academy →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="path-card" href="/top-40">
              <div class="path-num">03</div>
              <div class="path-kicker">The company</div>
              <h3>Renegade Top 40</h3>
              <p>A serious working group for independent mortgage brokerage owners who want to move beyond personal production and build a stronger, more scalable company.</p>
              <span class="path-link">Explore Top 40 →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PROGRESSION BAND -->
      <section class="band progression-band rv">
        <div class="wrap">
          <span class="band-ey">The Renegade progression</span>
          <h2 class="disp">Tools → Capability → Community → Company</h2>
          <p>The point isn't to collect more courses. It's to build more capability into the business.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- WHAT WE ARE / AREN'T -->
      <section class="sec sec-ink build-grid">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="philosophy-grid rv">
            <div>
              <span class="ey">What this is</span>
              <h2 class="disp">Useful people. Useful tools. <span class="g">Useful work.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="philosophy-copy">
              <p>Marketing Renegades isn't a generic marketing agency and it isn't supposed to become a giant vault of videos nobody watches.</p>
              <p>My role is increasingly simple: <strong>teach what I know, help people think strategically, facilitate the build, and bring the right people into the room when someone else knows more than I do.</strong></p>
              <p>That matters because the goal isn't dependence. The goal is to help you become more capable at creating demand, operating your marketing, leading people, and building the business you actually intended to own.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- DARIN -->
      <section class="sec sec-black">
        <div class="wrap darin rv">
          <div class="darin-photo">
            <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhmzbmbgv/image/upload/v1779927635/qxbvr39vr04gclalfb9b.jpg" alt="Darin Rhodes" loading="lazy">
            <span class="tag">Darin Rhodes</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="ey">Teacher · Strategist · Builder · Convener</span>
            <h2 class="disp">I've spent a long time building inside the same world <span class="g">I'm teaching in.</span></h2>
            <p>I've spent more than two decades in mortgage, along with years building businesses, teaching professionals, experimenting with marketing, and trying plenty of things that looked better on a whiteboard than they did in the real world.</p>
            <p>Renegades grew out of that experience. I like teaching. I like masterminding. I like putting smart people together and working on real problems. <strong>I don't need to pretend I'm the world's foremost expert in every tactic.</strong> When a specialist belongs in the room, we'll bring one in.</p>
            <div class="sig">
              <div><div class="nm">Darin Rhodes</div><div class="ti">Founder · Marketing Renegades</div></div>
              <a class="bd" href="/about">More about Darin →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- COMMUNITY -->
      <section class="community-cta">
        <div class="wrap community-in rv">
          <span class="ey">Not sure where to start?</span>
          <h2 class="disp">Come hang out with <span>the Renegades.</span></h2>
          <p>Join the free community for useful marketing ideas, live discussion, experiments with new technology, and conversations with other independent business owners and mortgage professionals.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://community.gorenegades.com">Join the Renegades <span class="ar">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 0 100px;background:var(--black)}
  .home-glow{position:absolute;top:-260px;right:-180px;width:900px;height:900px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(244,194,13,.15),rgba(244,194,13,.04) 42%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .home-hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .home-hero .ey{margin-bottom:28px}
  .home-hero h1{font-size:clamp(66px,11.8vw,178px);max-width:9.5ch;margin:0;line-height:.82}
  .home-hero h1 span{display:block}
  .home-hero h1 .gold{color:var(--gold)}
  .home-lead{font-size:clamp(21px,2.4vw,30px);line-height:1.35;max-width:850px;margin-top:38px;color:var(--white);letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .home-sub{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;max-width:700px;margin-top:20px;color:var(--smoke)}
  .home-body{color:var(--smoke);font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;max-width:720px;margin-top:22px}

  .path-head{max-width:850px}
  .path-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:56px}
  .path-card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:480px;padding:34px 30px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--ink);transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease,background .2s ease}
  .path-card:hover{border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-6px)}
  .path-card.featured{border:2px solid var(--gold);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(244,194,13,.08),var(--ink) 42%)}
  .path-num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:70px;line-height:.8;color:var(--gold)}
  .path-kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke);margin-top:28px}
  .path-card h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(34px,3.5vw,50px);line-height:.9;margin-top:10px}
  .path-card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--smoke);margin-top:22px}
  .path-link{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-top:auto;padding-top:34px}

  .progression-band{text-align:left}
  .progression-band .band-ey{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2a2202;display:block;margin-bottom:20px}
  .progression-band h2{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,82px)}
  .progression-band p{margin-left:0;margin-right:0;max-width:760px}

  .philosophy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
  .philosophy-grid h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5.4vw,74px)}
  .philosophy-copy{padding-top:38px}
  .philosophy-copy p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--smoke);margin-bottom:22px}
  .philosophy-copy strong{color:var(--white)}

  .sig .bd{text-decoration:none}

  .community-cta{position:relative;padding:110px 0;background:var(--ink);text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .community-in{max-width:900px}
  .community-cta h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.9;font-size:clamp(50px,8vw,110px);margin-top:20px}
  .community-cta h2 span{color:var(--gold)}
  .community-cta p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--smoke);max-width:680px;margin:28px auto 38px}

  @media(max-width:900px){
    .path-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .path-card{min-height:auto}
    .philosophy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}
    .philosophy-copy{padding-top:0}
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){
    .home-hero{padding:82px 0 72px}
    .home-hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,19vw,100px)}
    .home-lead{font-size:21px}
    .path-card{padding:30px 24px}
    .community-cta{padding:80px 0}
  }
</style>
